python3-pyfasm64 (1.1.0-1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Release PyFASM64 1.1.0 (Comprehensive Modern GUI & Framework Enhancement).
  * Removed legacy canvas template fallbacks; all canvas, plotting, and graphic applications now compile authentically from user AST directly into native Win64 machine code.
  * Added deep CustomTkinter and Flet support (CTkFont, CTkImage, CTkEntry.delete/insert Win32 edit routing, cget, page.clean(), page.window_width/height, event attributes, 16+ modern UI containers).
  * Added native SIMD/scalar x86-64 assembly loops for min() and max(), and built-in support for tuple(), complex(), math.isfinite(), math.isclose(), and getattr().

 -- eminsk <M_N_N@tut.by>  Sat, 21 Nov 2026 13:40:00 -0500

python3-pyfasm64 (1.0.0-1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Release PyFASM64 1.0.0 (Production Stable Milestone).
  * Fixed recursive and mutually-recursive nested def functions (ClosureLifter self/sibling reference lifting) and local function-alias return-type propagation under --strict mode.
  * Added reflected binary operator dunders (__radd__, __rsub__, __rmul__, __rtruediv__, __rfloordiv__, __rmod__), __abs__ in abs(x), f-string !r conversion, and f-string format specifiers (:.Nf, :N.Mf, :x, :X, :b, :o, :0Nd, :Nd).
  * Added full native Win64 framework compilation for tkinter, customtkinter, PyQt5, PyQt6, PySide6, and flet (closure WM_COMMAND dispatch, signal .clicked.connect, StringVar, colored Canvas primitives, and Flet page/control reactivity).
  * Added native Win32 GDI double-buffered 2D game engine runtime for pygame (set_mode, event queue, GetAsyncKeyState, Rect collision/geometry, Clock.tick, SysFont/render/blit).
  * Added native Win64 Winsock2 HTTP/1.1 + RFC-8259 JSON server runtime for FastAPI & uvicorn (route harvesting, APIRouter/include_router, await-free async def route lowering, path/query/body params with UTF-8 percent-decoding, HTMLResponse/PlainTextResponse/JSONResponse, and /openapi.json).

 -- eminsk <M_N_N@tut.by>  Sat, 21 Nov 2026 11:45:00 -0500

python3-pyfasm64 (0.4.0-1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Release PyFASM64 0.4.0.
  * Added full Cyrillic/Unicode identifier support via collision-free FASM labels and UTF-8 codepoint len(), indexing, slicing, and Cyrillic .upper()/.lower() (including Ё/ё).
  * Eliminated memory-address printing in Win64 typed/mixed lists, 2D lists, tuples, dicts, sets, loops, f-strings, and str()/int()/float()/.split() conversions.
  * Added runtime class tags (PYFCLSTG), polymorphic virtual method dispatch (_pyfasm_vcall_*), @staticmethod, @classmethod, isinstance()/issubclass(), and full dunder wiring (__call__, __bool__, __neg__/__pos__/__invert__, __iadd__..__ixor__, __enter__/__exit__, __iter__/__next__ + StopIteration).
  * Implemented real lexical closures (ClosureLifter + PYFCLOSU) for capturing lambdas and nested def functions across direct calls, higher-order calls, map(), and filter().

